      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.46,
      "end_seconds": 50.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Okay, so roughly three to four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.43,
      "end_seconds": 54.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "I, I suppose so, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.59,
      "end_seconds": 59.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Okay, have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.69,
      "end_seconds": 82.18,
      "duration_seconds": 21.49,
      "text": "Redness around the sore goes along with it, most of the time i've also had a smell from the dressing and I've been feeling feverish as well, for about a week about feeling feverish, it's a couple of times a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.73,
      "end_seconds": 83.52,
      "duration_seconds": 0.79,
      "text": "hm okay"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.68,
      "end_seconds": 101.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.61,
      "end_seconds": 109.31,
      "duration_seconds": 5.7,
      "text": "yes, um, I had a triple bypass, eight years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.38,
      "end_seconds": 113.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.19,
      "end_seconds": 117.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "yes, milk, it gives me a rash"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.32,
      "end_seconds": 138.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.19,
      "end_seconds": 143.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.4,
      "end_seconds": 146.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Do you work outside the home?"
